<title>ESTONIA: Estonian Talinvest to form investment bank soon.</title>
<headline>Estonian Talinvest to form investment bank soon.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian investment company Talinvest said on Thursday that it aimed to form its pan-Baltic investment bank within the next month or two.</p>
<p>Talinvest earlier announced the purchase of 87 percent in one of Lithuania's leading brokers, Suprema, and said it was aiming for an investment bank to offer brokerage and corporate finance services in all three Baltic states.</p>
<p>Talinvest sales and trading director Aare Tammemae said the new bank would formed in February or March.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be headquartered in Tallinn,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>Talinvest recently became a member of the Latvian stock market and will have its own office in the Latvian capital.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
